{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05353","headline":"奉和御制乾曜与张说宋璟同日上官命宴都堂赐诗 · 源乾曜","name":"奉和御制乾曜与张说宋璟同日上官命宴都堂赐诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"睿作超千古，湛恩育万人。\n递迁俱荷泽，同拜忽爲邻。\n道合徽音畅，芳辰景命新。\n鼓钟崇享礼，鵷鹭集朝伦。\n窃位思官谤，凋容谢木春。\n慙多无以叙，拙备实难陈。\n进绶怀三少，承光尽百身。\n自当归第日，何幸列宫臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"源乾曜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}